    <preface>
      <p><b>QANTAS AIRWAYS LIMITED (LOAN GUARANTEE) AMENDMENT ACT 1978</b></p>
      <p><b>No. 186 of 1978</b></p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Qantas Airways Limited </i>(<i>Loan Guarantee</i>)<i> Act </i>1978.</p>
      <p>BE IT ENACTED by the Queen, and the Senate and House of Representatives of the Commonwealth of Australia, as follows:</p>
      <p><b>Short title, &amp;c.</b></p>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <subsection eId="sec-1__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p><b>1.</b> (1) This Act may be cited as the <i>Qantas Airways Limited </i>(<i>Loan Guarantee</i>)<i> Amendment Act </i>1978.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-1__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>(2) The <i>Qantas Airways Limited </i>(<i>Loan Guarantee</i>)<i> Act </i>1978 is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>2.</b> This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Guarantee of certain loans</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>3.</b> Section 4 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from paragraph (a) of sub-section (1) “for expenditure” and substituting “not exceeding its expenditure”.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
